Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Seyf yangi: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault shifrlash: message kalit: key.
>> decrypted := vault shifrni-ochish: encrypted kalit: key.

Chiqish 
yozish: ['Message:'], yangi-qator
yozish: message, yangi-qator
yozish: ['Decrypted:'], yangi-qator
yozish: decrypted, yangi-qator.
